WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:05.800
Pinky here! Factored quadratics look scary.

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.800
But they're basically handing you the answer.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.600
You just have to read them.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:13.460
Here's the whole idea.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.820
If two things multiply to zero,

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:19.680
at least one of them has to be zero.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.100
There's no other way to get zero out of a multiplication.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:27.400
So look. X minus three,

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.540
times x plus five,

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.780
equals zero. Two factors.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.240
Make the first one zero:

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:34.680
x is three.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:36.560
Make the second one zero:

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.500
x is negative five.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.000
Those are the solutions.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:42.560
Watch that sign!

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:45.340
Plus five gives you negative five.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:47.640
And if they ask for the sum?

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.800
Three plus negative five is negative two.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:56.720
Your turn. X minus two,

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.900
times x plus six,

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:02.580
equals zero. What is the sum of the solutions?

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:06.180
Go.

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:15.450
Negative four! The solutions are two and negative six.

00:01:17.690 --> 00:01:18.730
Here's a shortcut.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:22.750
If it's written x squared plus b x plus c,

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:25.670
the solutions add up to negative b.

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:27.610
Multiply ours out:

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:30.790
x squared plus two x minus fifteen.

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:32.730
B is two,

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:34.670
so the sum is negative two.

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.150
Same answer!

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:39.110
And if there's a number in front of x squared,

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:43.310
that's A, and the sum is negative b over A.

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:46.770
But this only gives you the sum.

00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:48.350
Not the solutions themselves.

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:50.170
And keep track of the signs,

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:51.630
and that leading number.

00:01:53.150 --> 00:01:55.050
So before you start,

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:56.510
read what they want.

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:58.610
One solution. Both.

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:00.930
Their sum. Or their product.

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:03.450
Now hit Try this skill!
